      {
        "id": "7f14fc92-3de6-4ca9-ac57-92742516ed4e",
        "date": "2026-07-02T04:14:19.701Z",
        "order": 4,
        "seriesId": "0908d142-9b5c-4aee-9701-57660ed4c60f",
        "ebookId": "71b6699d-e650-4c0c-a1a0-a9ebd7fb65a7",
        "ebook": {
          "id": "71b6699d-e650-4c0c-a1a0-a9ebd7fb65a7",
          "at": "tsukimichi-vol-4",
          "title": "Tsukimichi - Vol. 4",
          "subtitle": "Moonlit Fantasy",
          "description": "Early 140,000 Copies Sold! The Highly Anticipated Fourth Volume of the Misfortunate Boy's Isekai Rise to Power Fantasy!\r\n\r\nMakoto Misumi, an ordinary high school student, finds himself suddenly transported to another world. Having resolved a series of conflicts in Tsige, he now sets his sights on the Academy City of Rotsgard. However, his journey takes an unexpected turn when he loses consciousness and is kidnapped by unknown forces.\r\n\r\nHe awakens in the midst of a battlefield, where a mysterious woman with a fierce smile stands before him, poised to strike with her massive sword. Surrounded by chaos, Makoto must navigate this perilous situation and overcome the greatest danger he has faced yet. Will Makoto, the unlucky hero who seems to attract trouble, manage to survive this dire predicament?",
          "visible": true,
