      {
        "id": "9e7f7cff-3396-4613-b79f-29e64a6e2340",
        "date": "2026-07-02T04:14:19.701Z",
        "order": 5,
        "seriesId": "0908d142-9b5c-4aee-9701-57660ed4c60f",
        "ebookId": "e38a6b0d-81b7-4f87-af12-ac48cee053d5",
        "ebook": {
          "id": "e38a6b0d-81b7-4f87-af12-ac48cee053d5",
          "at": "tsukimichi-vol-5",
          "title": "Tsukimichi - Vol. 5",
          "subtitle": "Moonlit Fantasy",
          "description": "With over 170,000 copies sold, the tale of an unlucky young man’s rise to success in another world continues—Volume 5 is finally here!\r\n\r\nAfter countless struggles, Makoto, an ordinary high school student, reaches his long-sought destination: the academy city of Rotsgard.\r\n\r\nHis goal is simple—to learn more about this strange new world by enrolling in its famous academy. But things don’t go as planned. Instead of an entrance exam, Makoto finds himself taking a test meant for teacher candidates!\r\n\r\nAnd so begins the unpredictable and often chaotic school life of Misumi Makoto, a young man whose knack for attracting trouble shows no signs of slowing down.",
