      {
        "id": "f00adee9-6bff-4b63-9dc3-00ef4e603b1a",
        "date": "2026-07-02T04:14:19.701Z",
        "order": 7,
        "seriesId": "0908d142-9b5c-4aee-9701-57660ed4c60f",
        "ebookId": "b45cf6ac-1876-424d-8dfa-a1a47867e863",
        "ebook": {
          "id": "b45cf6ac-1876-424d-8dfa-a1a47867e863",
          "at": "tsukimichi-vol-7",
          "title": "Tsukimichi - Vol. 7",
          "subtitle": "Moonlit Fantasy",
          "description": "While managing his merchant duties, Makoto is also thoroughly enjoying his role as a teacher in Rotsgard. With the long-awaited school festival finally underway and the grand tournament just around the corner, the excitement among his students is reaching a fever pitch.\r\n\r\nHowever, just as the festivities reach their peak, a series of unforeseen calamities descends upon Makoto and his class, jeopardizing the enjoyment.\r\n\r\nThe perpetually unlucky storm magnet, Makoto Misumi, stands prepared to confront the chaos head-on!",
