      {
        "id": "71fc0da0-e1a6-4342-9e7e-851bfcb95315",
        "date": "2026-07-02T04:14:19.701Z",
        "order": 9,
        "seriesId": "0908d142-9b5c-4aee-9701-57660ed4c60f",
        "ebookId": "43425544-5a8f-4e7e-81e3-a428b1c03a25",
        "ebook": {
          "id": "43425544-5a8f-4e7e-81e3-a428b1c03a25",
          "at": "tsukimichi-vol-8-5",
          "title": "Tsukimichi - Vol. 8.5",
          "subtitle": "Moonlit Fantasy",
          "description": "A fully original side story from the hit underdog fantasy!\r\n\r\nWith Rotsgard entering summer break, Makoto seizes the opportunity to focus on improving his magical output. While training, he comes across a paper on “mana materialization” that sparks a breakthrough—leading him to develop a brand-new power to protect the Demiplane.\r\n\r\nHarnessing his overwhelming mana and razor-sharp focus, he gives form to a shifting, fluid force: the Mana Body!\r\n\r\nEven the strongest of the Demiplane are left stunned by this fearsome new ability—what exactly is Makoto’s latest trump card!?",
