          "at": "tsukimichi-vol-10",
          "title": "Tsukimichi - Vol. 10",
          "subtitle": "Moonlit Fantasy",
          "description": "Two monsters. One city. And no more room to hold back.\r\n\r\nTo rescue the hero from the demon assault, Makoto and Shiki are sent to Limia’s capital, where they repel the towering demon general—all while keeping their true identities under wraps.\r\n\r\nBut just as things seem to settle, a new threat crashes onto the stage: the deadliest human swordswoman—Sofia, the Dragon Slayer—and her partner, the blade-dragon Lancer.\r\n\r\nTheir devastating rain of swords leaves the capital in ruins.\r\n\r\nNow, a berserker empowered by the fallen greater dragons’ might launches a relentless assault on Makoto… and he’ll have to face a whole new level of madness.",
